; onehotr_without_grid: ONEHOTR on a model with no grid must raise.
;
; Forgetting RESIZE is the expensive mistake in this instruction family:
; without the check the constraint is silently absent and the model solves
; cleanly to a wrong answer.

PUSH 4
BQMX r0

PUSH 0           ; row
PUSH 1           ; penalty
ONEHOTR r0
HALT
